── General
?        help                                                       
q        close, or quit at the root                                 
esc      back out one level                                         
ctrl+c   cancel the running command, else quit                      
gm       messages and the last failure                              
── Move
gg       top                                                        
G        bottom                                                     
j/down   down a line                                                
k/up     up a line                                                  
ctrl+d   half a page down                                           
ctrl+u   half a page up                                             
── Submit
enter    run the plan: push, then open and edit the pull requests   jj git push …; gh pr create …; gh pr edit …
── Flags
-d       new pull requests open as drafts (--draft)                 gh pr create --draft
